	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi postremas tuas, observandissime domine, quas <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>per <persName>Ioannem Damium</persName> <placeName>Palatinensem</placeName> ad me misisti, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>de quo miror quod nihil aliud scribas quam eum cupere <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cum ministris colloqui et ecclesias invisere, cum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tamen nobis videatur alterius rei nomine ad has ecclesia<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>s proficisci; defert enim secum libellum, in quo centum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>propositiones de iustificatione sunt conscriptae, quarum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>scopus est (quod dogma ipse quoque egregie tuetur) obedient<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>iae Christi in negotio redemptionis nostrae nihil esse <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tribuendum; oportuisse quidem Christum, ut talis esset, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>qui nos patiendo redimeret, praestare obedientiam legis; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sed hoc ipsum propter nos quidem, sed non pro nobis fecisse; <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>unicae enim passioni eius redemptionem tribuendam, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cum tamen nos sentiamus Christum totum illud, quod <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>fecit, pro nobis fecisse, et quod obediens factus est et quod <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>passus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sicut enim per inobedientiam unius homines <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>peccatores constituti sumus multi, ita per obedientiam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>unius iusti constituuntur multi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Miror itaque, an vobiscum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nihil hac de re contulerit et an theses illas non videritis <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>aut quod vestrum de his sit iudicium.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dicit illarum au<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>thorem esse quendam ministrum in <placeName ref="l2835">Franconia</placeName> et probari <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>eas d. <persName ref="p8453">Ursino</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed suspicamur eas aut ipsius aut <placeName ref="l210">Heidelber<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>gensis</placeName> alicuius esse et ipsum huius rei gratia <placeName ref="l167">Genevam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>adire, ut iudicium d. <persName ref="p8033">Bezae</persName> super his cognoscat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Videmus, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quam ferax sit seculum nostrum novarum opinionum; ideo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>multa cautione opus est, et timemus, ne <placeName ref="l210">Heidelbergensibus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>aliquid obrepat eiusmodi sicut <placeName ref="l2472">Polonis</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Cupimus ergo tuum iudicium <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>cognoscere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nos agnoscimus totum Christum esse redemptor<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>em nostrum nec separamus passionem ab obedientia sicut <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>nec hanc ab illa, ne dividatur Christus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Alias quod nunc scribam, non habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">De foedere nihil <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>dicitur amplius.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Expectamus audire, quid in <placeName ref="l648">Rhoetia</placeName> fiat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Dominus <persName ref="p8063">Steigerus</persName>, <persName ref="p3659">Mülinensis</persName> et reliqui, fratres item ac <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>symmystae, socer, mater et uxor te plurimum salutant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Sa<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>luta ex me tuos quoque.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 26. martii 1565.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>De rebus <placeName ref="l832">Gallicis</placeName> et <placeName ref="l167">Genevensibus</placeName> audies ex hoc illustri comite <lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p2054">Ulysse Martinengo</persName>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">Io[a<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>nnes] Hallerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pastori fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ac compatri summa mihi semper <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>fide colendo<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Hinweis: Urkunde vom 28. März 1565, in der bestätigt wird, das der Heirat von Romanus Huͤeberli von <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> nichts im Wege steht (Heirat in Lyon); eigenhändiger Entwurf <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName>, in: Zürich ZB, Ms L 87, f. 92</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
